ter\"></div><p data-ix=\"fade-up-3\" class=\"paragraph-big hero-text\">From hand-picking our own produce directly from Eastern Market, to making our own salad dressing, Soprano's does everything the old world way! At Soprano's we guarantee you will love our excellent food, professional service, and competitive prices.</p><a href=\"/contact\" data-ix=\"fade-up-4\" class=\"button hero-button w-button\">Contact Us</a></div></div></div><div aria-live=\"off\" aria-atomic=\"true\" class=\"w-slider-aria-label\" data-wf-ignore=\"\"></div></div><div class=\"slider-arrow arrow-left w-hidden-small w-hidden-tiny w-slider-arrow-left\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"w-slider-mask-0\" aria-label=\"previous slide\"></div><div class=\"slider-arrow arrow-right w-slider-arrow-right\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"w-slider-mask-0\" aria-label=\"next slide\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"w-hidden-main w-hidden-medium w-hidden-small w-hidden-tiny w-slider-nav w-round\"><div class=\"w-slider-dot w-active\" data-wf-ignore=\"\" aria-label=\"Show slide 1 of 1\" aria-pressed=\"true\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 3px; margin-right: 3px;\"></div></div></div></header><div id=\"Scroll-Section\" class=\"section specials\"><div class=\"wrapper banner w-container\"><div class=\"section-header-wrapper seasonal\"><h2 data-w-id=\"ce565286-eed9-2f81-ad34-efd62d10f73e\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"heading\">NEW&nbsp;WINTER&nbsp;SPECIALS</h2><a href=\"/seasonal-specials\" data-ix=\"fade-up-4\" data-w-id=\"31f3a18d-a1c7-1558-9918-9f9e94be8016\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"button hp w-button\">Winter Specials</a></div></div></div><div id=\"Scroll-Section\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrapper w-container\"><div class=\"section-header-wrapper\"><div data-w-id=\"3fa338d4-81f6-dbf4-c58e-5148d3d96537\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"sub-header\">Discover</div><h2 data-w-id=\"3fa338d4-81f6-dbf4-c58e-5148d3d96539\" style=\"opacity: 0;\">OUR&nbsp;SERVICES</h2><div data-w-id=\"3fa338d4-81f6-dbf4-c58e-5148d3d9653b\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"divider\"></div></div><p data-w-id=\"3fa338d4-81f6-dbf4-c58e-5148d3d9653c\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"paragraph-big intro-text\">We handle all occasions large and small, no matter what your catering needs might be, give us a call to see if your date is available. Soprano's Catering offers a wide range of pick up and drop off selections for your next catered event including: breakfast, lunch, and box lunches, appetizers, BBQ and dinner options as well as full service catering for large corporate events and weddings.</p><div data-collapse=\"medium\" data-animation=\"default\" data-duration=\"400\" data-easing=\"ease\" data-easing2=\"ease\" role=\"banner\" class=\"nav-bar fixed-nav-bar w-nav\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0px, -100%, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\"><div class=\"wrapper w-container\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\" class=\"logo fixed-nav-bar-logo w-nav-brand w--current\" aria-label=\"home\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/6282c7f83222b1b1c09c2d5a_Sopranos_Black.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" sizes=\"180px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/6282c7f83222b1b1c09c2d5a_Sopranos_Black-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/6282c7f83222b1b1c09c2d5a_Sopranos_Black-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/6282c7f83222b1b1c09c2d5a_Sopranos_Black-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/6282c7f83222b1b1c09c2d5a_Sopranos_Black-p-1600.png 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/6282c7f83222b1b1c09c2d5a_Sopranos_Black-p-2000.png 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/6282c7f83222b1b1c09c2d5a_Sopranos_Black-p-2600.png 2600w, https://cdn.p