" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"w-nav-overlay-2\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><div class=\"icon w-icon-nav-menu\"></div></div></div><div class=\"w-nav-overlay\" data-wf-ignore=\"\" id=\"w-nav-overlay-2\"></div></div></div><a href=\"/corporate-events\" data-ix=\"fade-up-4\" data-w-id=\"3fa338d4-81f6-dbf4-c58e-5148d3d9653f\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"button hp w-button\">Corporate Events</a><a href=\"/social-events\" data-ix=\"fade-up-4\" data-w-id=\"3fa338d4-81f6-dbf4-c58e-5148d3d96541\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"button hp w-button\">Social Events</a><a href=\"/weddings\" data-ix=\"fade-up-4\" data-w-id=\"3fa338d4-81f6-dbf4-c58e-5148d3d96543\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"button hp w-button\">Weddings</a><a href=\"/grill-and-bbq\" data-ix=\"fade-up-4\" data-w-id=\"3fa338d4-81f6-dbf4-c58e-5148d3d96545\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"button hp w-button\">Grill &amp;&nbsp;BBQ</a><a href=\"/catered-trays\" data-ix=\"fade-up-4\" data-w-id=\"3fa338d4-81f6-dbf4-c58e-5148d3d96547\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"button hp w-button\">By The Tray</a></div><div id=\"Features\" class=\"section no-paddings\"></div><div class=\"bg-section cta-section\"><div class=\"wrapper w-container\"><div data-ix=\"fade-up-1\" class=\"cta-content\"><div data-w-id=\"b5f00a36-3182-a0fd-0e71-41b44fa5dd84\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"sub-header\">Reserve Today</div><h2 data-w-id=\"eba5040d-99c7-949a-df28-db7a443c7ab7\" style=\"opacity: 0;\">CHECK&nbsp;YOUR&nbsp;DATE</h2><div data-w-id=\"79b1062a-5296-4c26-cc52-24fff1d3323c\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"divider\"></div><p data-w-id=\"17c64134-ac89-3e0a-3456-5ada5eb3115c\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"section-description\">Contact us today to check our schedule of events and reserve your dates. We are happy to discuss all of your needs and design a package that is right for you and your special event.</p><a href=\"/contact\" data-w-id=\"384f5d75-d23f-955f-4e4f-623e80e9ca76\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"button w-button\">Contact Us</a></div></div></div><div class=\"section pattern-section no-bottom-padding\"><div class=\"wrapper w-container\"><div class=\"side-card-feature\"><div data-w-id=\"7c73ff80-8df2-7305-3d73-92b2f24be052\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"side-card-image _1\"></div><div data-ix=\"fade-left\" data-w-id=\"ff252e3a-eb22-b78e-16eb-59bce7170bde\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"side-card\"><div class=\"side-card-content\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/62829164e1b0c615ae8a3f84_dinner-icon.png\" alt=\"Wedding Dinner\" class=\"big-icon\"><h3 class=\"side-card-header\">WEDDINGS</h3><div class=\"divider\"></div><p class=\"grey-text\">We couldn’t be happier that you’re considering us to cater your wedding. Our chefs understand the importance of your wedding day and will work closely with you to ensure every detail is considered and every expectation exceeded.</p><a href=\"/weddings\" data-ix=\"fade-up-4\" data-w-id=\"4a65ab59-2e1c-647f-5044-3c2a6534f6fd\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"button w-button\">Wedding Menus</a></div><div class=\"frame\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section pattern-section\"><div class=\"wrapper w-container\"><div class=\"side-card-feature reversed\"><div data-ix=\"fade-right\" data-w-id=\"0e0ee31f-de97-ce02-c2d0-31edad2e26a5\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"side-card reversed\"><div class=\"side-card-content\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/62829164e1b0c63d7f8a3fcc_apple-icon.png\" alt=\"Fresh food\" class=\"big-icon\"><h3 class=\"side-card-header\">FRESH&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;INSPIRED</h3><div class=\"divider\"></div><p class=\"grey-text\">Culinary innovation and impeccable service is the cornerstone of Soprano’s Catering. We are committed to building long term relationships based on personal service and exceptional quality. Choose from one of our menu options or let our chefs design a menu specifically for you.</p><a href=\"/social-events\" data-ix=\"fade-up-4\" data-w-id=\"25e71cdc-e356-5055-142b-cae479855ee9\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"button w-button\">Social Events</a></div><div class=\"frame\"></div></div><div data-w-id=\"751ccc8f-3f53-1ad5-f5cd-651091fa2856\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"side-card-image _2\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section pattern-section\"><div class=\"wrapper w-container\"><div class=\"features\"><div data-ix=\"fade-right\" data-w-id=\"d3f7b76d-de99-83fa-e711-451e0fb027eb\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"feature-image _1\"><h3 class=\"feature-image-header\">SERVICE&nbsp;STYLES</h3><p>Soprano's makes catering easy with several service style options. From pick up and drop off, to full service packages, there is an option suited for any special occasion.</p><a href=\"/service-styles\" class=\"button small-button white-hover-button w-button\">Service Styles</a></div><div data-ix=\"fade-left\" data-w-id=\"484c7fd5-06aa-3beb-174a-e8253800cf4a\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"feature-image _2\"><h3 class=\"feature-image-header\">VENUES&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;VENDORS</h3><p>Occasionally we'll come across people and businesses who share our passion for excellence. When we do, we're happy to recommend them to our clients. Below, you'll find a few partners we are proud to recommend based on our shared experience.</p><a href=\"/venues-vendors\" class=\"button small-button white-hover-button w-button\">Venues &amp;&nbsp;Vendors</a></div><div data-ix=\"fade-right\" data-w-id=\"15b28208-2395-69ff-78df-3ca0c68613ea\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"feature-text\"><h4>WE&nbsp;ARE&nbsp;HERE&nbsp;TO&nbsp;SERVE&nbsp;YOU</h4><p class=\"grey-text\">We can prepare a quote for you for just a few pans of food for a small get together or help plan your next big celebration. We have relationships with all the area's best event vendors and can act as your one-stop-shop for anything event related. Contact our event specialists today to see if your date is available. We look forward to hearing more about your event!</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section pattern-section\"><div class=\"wrapper w-container\"><div class=\"side-image-wrapper\"><img class=\"side-image\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/62829164e1b0c6cb488a3f85_gallery-image-04.jpg\" alt=\"Fresh food made right\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 728px, 800px\" data-w-id=\"44e43b9c-af11-999f-1c86-1feb29c04bc2\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/62829164e1b0c6cb488a3f85_gallery-image-04-p-500.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/62829164e1b0c6cb488a3f85_gallery-image-04.jpg 800w\"><div data-ix=\"fade-left\" class=\"side-image-content\"><div data-w-id=\"8027923c-8a54-3894-5d6c-06fe26b4522f\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"sub-header\">Our Promise</div><h2 data-w-id=\"507cf9d6-269f-3020-8d18-b36d70e138c8\" style=\"opacity: 0;\">Made with Love</h2><div data-w-id=\"f55b6c00-a63b-fc09-68b4-0d2698d5ec45\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"divider\"></div><p data-w-id=\"8a665940-fd5f-4da3-76b5-2ff45789fa6c\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" class=\"grey-text\">Whether you are having a small family gathering or celebrating a holiday Soprano’s Catering wants you to be able to enjoy the day with your family and friends and leave the cooking to us, at Soprano's Catering we are here to serve you!</p></div></div></div></div><footer class=\"bg-section footer-section\"><div class=\"wrapper w-container\"><div class=\"footer\"><div class=\"footer-column\"><h3 class=\"footer-header\">Contact Info</h3><p>Sopranos Catering<br>17600 Clinton River Road<br>Clinton Township, MI 48038</p><a href=\"mailto:info@sopranoscatering.com?subject=Hello!\" class=\"footer-email\">info@sopranoscatering.com</a><p><a href=\"tel:15867019526\" class=\"phone\">1 (800) WE-CATER</a></p><div class=\"social-icons footer-icons\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sopranoscatering\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"social-link w-inline-block\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/62829164e1b0c625208a3f93_facebook-icon-white.svg\" alt=\"click to view Sopranos Facebook page\"></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sopranoscatering/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"social-link w-inline-block\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/62829164e1b0c607678a3fa5_instagram-icon-white.svg\" alt=\"Click to visit Sopranos Instagram\"></a></div></div><div class=\"footer-column\"><h5 class=\"footer-header\">Navigation</h5><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\" class=\"footer-link w--current\">Home</a><div class=\"footer-link-badge\"><a href=\"/weddings\" class=\"footer-link\">Weddings</a></div><div class=\"footer-link-badge\"><a href=\"/corporate-events\" class=\"footer-link\">Corporate Events</a></div><div class=\"footer-link-badge\"><a href=\"/social-events\" class=\"footer-link\">Social Events</a></div><a href=\"/grill-and-bbq\" class=\"footer-link\">Grill &amp;&nbsp;BBQ</a><a href=\"/catered-trays\" class=\"footer-link\">By The Tray</a><a href=\"/appetizers-and-enhancements\" class=\"footer-link\">Apps &amp; Enhancements</a><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"footer-link\">Contact</a></div><div class=\"footer-column\"><h5 class=\"footer-header\">OUR&nbsp;AWARDS</h5><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/62829b6e66b7273303764640_1-Sopranos-badge.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" alt=\"The Knot Best of Weddings Award 2022\" class=\"footer-badge\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/62829bd229589a428e8e1dde_Vote-4-The-Best.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" alt=\"Vote 4 the Best Voted Best Caterer\" class=\"footer-badge\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/62829bab48e4a67e2634331e_inverse.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" alt=\"Expertise Best Caterer in Detroit 2019\" class=\"footer-badge\"></div><div class=\"footer-column\"><h5 class=\"footer-header\">Proudly Serving</h5><p>Proudly Catering to Armada, Auburn Hills, Birmingham, Bloomfield Hills, Centerline, Chesterfield, Clarkston, Clinton Township, Detroit, Fraser, Grosse Pointe, Lenox Macomb County, Macomb Township, Mount Clemens, New Haven, Oakland County, Oakland Township, Orion Township, Ray Township, Richmond, Rochester, Rochester Hills, Romeo, Roseville, Royal Oak, Shelby Township, St. Clair County, St. Clair Shores, Sterling Heights, Troy, Utica, Warren, Washington Township, West Bloomfield, and more!</p></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><div class=\"footer-bottom-content\"><div class=\"footer-bottom-text\">© 2023 Sopranos Catering, All Rights Reserved</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"footer-bottom-base\"></div></footer></div><script src=\"https://d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net/js/jquery-3.5.1.min.dc5e7f18c8.js?site=62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44\" type=\"text/javascript\" integrity=\"sha256-9/aliU8dGd2tb6OSsuzixeV4y/faTqgFtohetphbbj0=\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script><script src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/js/webflow.schunk.36b8fb49256177c8.js\" type=\"text/javascript\" integrity=\"sha384-4abIlA5/v7XaW1HMXKBgnUuhnjBYJ/Z9C1OSg4OhmVw9O3QeHJ/qJqFBERCDPv7G\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script><script src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/js/webflow.schunk.4eace7c192b0599d.js\" type=\"text/javascript\" integrity=\"sha384-Wf6Aqne5nBqgLNfTvZDIXxfUqLcP5MXTHSehaiPQ6B8tWYLLIFmW63uU/IsJuf6l\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script><script src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62829164e1b0c6edc08a3f44/js/webflow.56a219bd.34f7c92eb3e8b1e1.js\" type=\"text/javascript\" integrity=\"sha384-PuuLWsvt++3ftdubJK245SFIjwYmOOoqcZVhEZ4WxqARbAMlrrO5ZXP6qWvKx+MM\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"//cdn.callrail.com/companies/644269930/93dbba4374c7a5ba02fa/12/swap.js\"></script><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://js.callrail.com/group/0/93dbba4